WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.480
Hi, I'm Dr. Kyle Bonesteel.

00:04.480 --> 00:09.180
I'm the CEO of NeuroHealth Associates and NeuroStratus Inc., and I have spent my entire

00:09.180 --> 00:14.840
career at the intersection of neuropsychology, diagnostics, and AI-driven healthcare innovation.

00:14.840 --> 00:19.960
And I've had the opportunity to see a lot of different approaches to AI implementation.

00:19.960 --> 00:25.080
And I've got to tell you, what has really, really impressed me about SYRV AI and Jarrod's

00:25.080 --> 00:28.760
entire team is that they don't just understand the technology.

00:28.760 --> 00:34.560
They understand how to actually make it work in real-world healthcare environments, appreciating

00:34.560 --> 00:39.520
the importance of workflow integration and security and compliance and all the operational

00:39.520 --> 00:44.480
realities that can make or break a successful implementation.

00:44.480 --> 00:48.720
The other characteristic that has really stood out to me is the velocity and the speed

00:48.720 --> 00:49.720
by which they work.

00:49.720 --> 00:52.400
They're very responsive as a team.

00:52.400 --> 00:57.200
I've worked with companies in the past that seem to get stuck in endless meetings and theoretical

00:57.200 --> 00:58.880
discussions.

00:58.880 --> 01:00.840
SYRV AI moves very, very differently.

01:00.840 --> 01:06.640
They're action oriented, they communicate well, and they actually get stuff done and built.

01:06.640 --> 01:11.080
And Jarrod and his team are also really amazing from a creativity standpoint.

01:11.080 --> 01:15.560
I would have an idea for my software platform and sort of magically that idea would be

01:15.560 --> 01:19.240
transformed into a tangible component within the platform.

01:19.240 --> 01:24.440
They're able to move from concept to implementation in weeks rather than months, while still

01:24.440 --> 01:29.360
having the extraordinary attention to detail that a project needs.

01:29.360 --> 01:31.680
So I can't say enough good things about SYRV.

01:31.680 --> 01:36.080
They've really taken our organization truly to the next level.

01:36.080 --> 01:40.200
And I am super excited to see what the future holds for us thanks to SYRV.
